From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 02:40:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(environment): spotlights fixed per tier with warmth
 by age

Hemisphere light, the tier's spotlights (3 high, 1 medium and low) fixed at
boot and reassigned on each settled arrival: a light that moves jumps to its
new mount at intensity 0, takes the target temperature and fades up over 1 s.
Hover lifts the visitor's own light to 1.35x over 250 ms; an open story dims
the other spots to 30% over 0.4 s; both instant under reduced motion and
?test=1. The Lightformer environment renders once into a 256 px cube through
a small LightformerEnvironment (drei's Environment module also bundles the
HDR loaders and preset CDN URLs: 17 KB gzip). Beam cones are one instanced
additive mesh, off on low. The greybox lighting is removed.

WP: WP-11
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
